        {
            "id": "csi_9_upsetting",
            "form": "caregiver_strain_index",
            "label": {
                "translation": "9. Some behaviour is upsetting (e.g., because of incontinence; ... has trouble remembering things; or ... accuses people of taking things) <br> 9. कुछ व्यवहार परेशान करते हैं (उदाहरण: असंयम, चीजें भूल जाना, दूसरों पर चोरी का आरोप लगाना)"
