            "form": "caregiver_strain_index",
            "label": {
                "translation": "10. It is upsetting to find that ... has changed so much from his/her former self (e.g., he/she is a different person now) <br> 10. यह परेशान करता है कि व्यक्ति पहले जैसा नहीं रहा (उदाहरण: वह अब पहले जैसा नहीं है)"
            },
            "enum": [
