            "form": "caregiver_strain_index",
            "label": {
                "translation": "11. There have been work adjustments (e.g., because of having to take time off) <br> 11. काम में बदलाव हुए हैं (उदाहरण: छुट्टी लेनी पड़ी)"
            },
            "enum": [
